{"id":"629341","name":"彩色小笼包","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/629341/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"4g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"菠菜汁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"3个"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"姜葱切片。","img":"images/629341/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加水榨成姜葱汁。","img":"images/629341/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉搅碎，加调料拌匀。","img":"images/629341/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"分次少量加葱姜水，搅匀，放冰箱冷藏10分钟，再次加入搅匀反复加入，让肉充分吸收姜葱水呈粘稠状。","img":"images/629341/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面团揉后排气，两个白面团长剂子，中间放绿面团剂子(温菠菜汁+酵母+少许小苏打)揉到一起，切块。","img":"images/629341/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"擀皮包馅。","img":"images/629341/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/629341/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放抹油蒸屉上再发酵15分钟。","img":"images/629341/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"水开蒸13分钟关火，焖3分钟开盖。","img":"images/629341/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629341/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629341/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}